  {
    "id" : "DL3052",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce Valid URL in Label",
    "description" : "This rule ensures that a specified label in a Dockerfile contains a valid URL.",
    "explanation" : "## Label `<label>` is not a valid URL.\n\nThis rule is activated by specifying a label-schema, where one label must contain a URL:\n```yaml\nlabel-schema:\n  website: url\n```\nor via command line:\n```bash\n$ hadolint --require-label website:url Dockerfile\n```\n\n### Problematic code:\n```Dockerfile\nLABEL website=\"not a url\"\n```\n\n### Correct code:\n```Dockerfile\nLABEL website=\"https://www.example.com\"\n```\n\n### Rationale:\nA label-schema may require a label to contain some URL, for example to ensure compliance to [standardized specifications](https://github.com/opencontainers/image-spec/blob/master/annotations.md).\n\n### Note:\nThis rule does not expand variables. It requires the value of the label to be a literal URL.",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
    "languages" : [
    ]
  },
  {
    "id" : "DL3053",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "ErrorProne",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Enforce RFC3339 Time Format in Labels",
    "description" : "Ensures that labels of type time in Dockerfiles conform to the RFC3339 timestamp format.",
    "explanation" : "## Label `<label>` is not a valid time format - must be conform to RFC3339.\nThis rule is activated by specifying a label-schema including a label of type rfc3339. This can be done via command line\n```bash\n$ hadolint --require-label created:rfc3339 Dockerfile\n```\nor in the config file:\n```yaml\nlabel-schema:\n  created: rfc3339\n```\n### Problematic code:\n```Dockerfile\nLABEL created=\"today\"\n```\n\n### Correct code:\n```Dockerfile\nLABEL created=\"2021-03-23 13:04:29.300508335+01:00\"\n```\n\n### Note:\nThis rule does not expand variables. It requires the value of a label to be a literal time stamp compliant with [RFC 3339](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3339).",
    "enabled" : false,
    "timeToFix" : 3,
