    "id" : "DL4000",
    "level" : "Warning",
    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Deprecated MAINTAINER Instruction",
    "description" : "This rule flags usage of the deprecated MAINTAINER instruction in Dockerfiles.",
    "explanation" : "## MAINTAINER is deprecated\n\n### Problematic code:\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM busybox\nMAINTAINER Lukas Martinelli <me@lukasmartinelli.ch>\n```\n\n### Correct code:\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM busybox\nLABEL maintainer=\"Lukas Martinelli <me@lukasmartinelli.ch>\"\n```\n### Rationale:\n\n`MAINTAINER` is deprecated since Docker 1.13.0: https://docs.docker.com/engine/deprecated/#maintainer-in-dockerfile",
